<?xml version="1.0"?>
<!--
  Unitree Dex3-1 (right hand) catalog entry for botrail-assets.

  Derived from unitreerobotics/xr_teleoperate assets/unitree_hand/
  unitree_dex3_right.urdf (Apache-2.0, (c) Unitree Robotics), commit
  845b25a3. Changes for catalog use:
    - teleop retarget frames (base_link, base_link_thumb/index/middle) and
      their marker-sphere visuals dropped; fingertip frames (thumb_tip,
      index_tip, middle_tip) kept as bare frames - they are the
      grasp_frames, and their 5 mm marker spheres would otherwise become
      collision geometry that pads every fingertip.
    - re-rooted at `mount`: the palm-origin mounting face (palm mesh spans
      x 0..86.7 mm), fingers extending +Z of the mount as tools do.
    - collision meshes switched to the upstream-shipped *.convex.stl.
    - `grasp_center` frame added at the zero-pose fingertip centroid
      (tcp_default).
  Mesh paths are sources-root-relative into the upstream fetch.
-->
